			<h2>Libraries for DSP & Measurement of Digital Audio</h2>
			<p>MAAT’s family of intellectual property and white label products are the fastest way to better sound. Whether it’s our world famous equalizers, our precision measurement tools, or our LIN and DR<em>i</em> libraries ready for integration, let us help you reduce development time while controlling costs and improving your products.
			</p>
