							<h3>LIN OEM Developer Kit</h3>
							<p>Better DSP starts with better dither…Does your product perform DSP on audio, even something as simple as gain? If so, you need to redither, and better dithering starts with better algorithms.</p>
							<p>LIN OEM incorporates a newly developed dither engine based on the current understanding of psychoacoustics, information theory and audio production best practices. As with other members of MAAT’s product family, extensive research and its double precision DSP architecture contribute to its uncompromising quality. The technology can be integrated into applications and utilities for macOS, Linux and Windows operating systems.
							</p>
							<p>Although dithering is usually considered an automatic function that can be ignored without consequence, quality–conscious engineers know that redithering prior to delivery is the last opportunity to define the quality of their product. LIN OEM includes seven modern choices for optimal noise shaping. Four of those options are derived from the most recent thinking in psychoacoustically optimized 5<sup>th</sup>, 8<sup>th</sup> and 9<sup>th</sup> order shapes.
							</p>
